    <string name="legal_dialog_title">Legal Disclaimer &amp; Privacy Notice</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_intro">This application is distributed free of charge and acts strictly as a client-side utility connecting directly to your own Azure Blob Storage. Please read the terms below carefully.</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_section1_title">1. GDPR &amp; Privacy Compliance</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_section1_text">This application operates entirely in a local context. The developer does not collect, monitor, transmit, or store any of your files, credentials, or personal data on external servers. All connection parameters (such as Storage Keys or SAS tokens) are encrypted and stored locally on your device. You are the sole controller of your data.</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_section2_title">2. Digital Services Act (DSA) Compliance</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_section2_text">The application is purely a client-side interface tool and does not act as a hosting provider, online platform, or content moderator. The developer does not store, index, publish, or share any of the files or contents you browse. You are solely responsible for ensuring that all data managed through this client complies with applicable laws, copyright regulations, and does not constitute illegal content.</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_section3_title">3. Limitation of Liability (EU Law)</string>
    <string name="legal_dialog_section3_text">Except in cases of willful misconduct, gross negligence, or death or personal injury (as required under mandatory European Union consumer protection laws), the developer provides this application \"as is\" without any warranty, express or implied. Under no circumstances shall the developer be liable for data loss, service interruption, or other indirect damages arising from the use or inability to use this software.</string>
